<p>Creates a popup help link</p>
<b>Parameters</b>
<ul><li> id = Unique identifier for the help popup</li>
<li> sourceFileName = File containing help content</li>
<li> sourcePageName = Page where help content is located</li>
<li> title = Optional title for the help link</li>
</ul>
